1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,918
Kenapa motong bawang

2
00:00:00,918 --> 00:00:01,953
bikin nangis?

3
00:00:01,953 --> 00:00:03,230
A, pedas?

4
00:00:03,230 --> 00:00:04,837
B, ada gas?

5
00:00:04,837 --> 00:00:06,601
C, cuma sugesti?

6
00:00:07,811 --> 00:00:09,070
Jawabannya...

7
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:10,749
B, GAS!

8
00:00:10,749 --> 00:00:11,296
Bawang punya

9
00:00:11,296 --> 00:00:12,759
senjata kimia!

10
00:00:12,759 --> 00:00:15,218
Dan ada bawang yang nggak bikin nangis...

11
00:00:15,218 --> 00:00:16,297
di akhir video.

12
00:00:16,297 --> 00:00:17,011
Begini prosesnya:

13
00:00:17,011 --> 00:00:19,249
saat dipotong, sel bawang pecah.

14
00:00:19,249 --> 00:00:22,365
Enzimnya mengubah zat belerang...

15
00:00:22,365 --> 00:00:24,115
jadi gas pemicu air mata.

16
00:00:24,115 --> 00:00:25,883
Gas itu sampai ke mata,

17
00:00:25,883 --> 00:00:26,811
dan air mata keluar

18
00:00:26,811 --> 00:00:28,047
untuk membilasnya!

19
00:00:28,047 --> 00:00:29,333
Mau nggak nangis?

20
00:00:29,333 --> 00:00:30,824
Dinginkan dulu di kulkas,

21
00:00:30,824 --> 00:00:32,011
pakai pisau yang tajam,

22
00:00:32,011 --> 00:00:34,187
dan potong akarnya paling akhir.

23
00:00:34,467 --> 00:00:35,524
Dan kejutannya:

24
00:00:35,524 --> 00:00:37,024
enzim pelakunya ditemukan

25
00:00:37,024 --> 00:00:38,952
ilmuwan Jepang tahun dua ribu dua.

26
00:00:38,952 --> 00:00:41,093
Sekarang sudah ada bawang hasil pemuliaan

27
00:00:41,093 --> 00:00:42,408
yang nggak bikin nangis,

28
00:00:42,408 --> 00:00:44,394
dijual di Amerika dan Inggris!

29
00:00:44,394 --> 00:00:45,706
Bawang memang kecil,

30
00:00:45,706 --> 00:00:47,260
tapi senjatanya kimia!

31
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:47,999
Kirim ke temanmu

32
00:00:47,999 --> 00:00:50,751
yang selalu nangis di dapur!

